<title>UK: Banque Indosuez sets 2.0 bln Lux franc 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banque Indosuez sets 2.0 bln Lux franc 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg, Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de l&quot;Etat and Banque Indosuez.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Banque Indosuez</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    31.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.55    PAY DATE    31.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.43 PCT</p>
<p> PRAECIPUUM 0.25	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY'S    AA3	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR DEBT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
